    "type": "u8",
    "note": "the side player 1's fighter faces (FBNeo training mode by peon2 and contributors, +0xE3 of the fighter object): a motion of the stick reads the other way round when the fighter faces left (1.39). What the byte holds when a round starts is learnt as facing right; not seen in a recorded game yet"
   },
